  Version 9~20261016.1 (2026-10-16)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * GRUB's background is the SparkyOS one (/etc/default/grub.d/20-sparkyos-artwork.cfg sets GRUB_BACKGROUND, which
    Sparky's and Debian's theme scripts use first); a background the person chose in /etc/default/grub or put
    into /boot/grub is kept

