  Version 9~20261016 (2026-10-16)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * First package of the SparkyOS artwork of release 9 (artwork repository 9~20261008.1): the Oxygen wallpaper, the GRUB background, the swirl pixmaps and the eighteen stereo wallpapers, installed as its install.sh does
  * The Oxygen wallpaper also as the Plasma wallpaper package SparkyOSOxygen, the default wallpaper of the Sparky Stereo Oxygen Plasma style
